{"parse": {"title": "十月无晴天-04", "pageid": 88955, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%81%E6%9C%88%E6%97%A0%E6%99%B4%E5%A4%A9-03\" title=\"十月无晴天-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">十月无晴天-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%81%E6%9C%88%E6%97%A0%E6%99%B4%E5%A4%A9-05\" title=\"十月无晴天-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">十月无晴天</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.84.B0.E7.81.AB.E6.8B.96.E5.B0.BE.E7.9A.84.E5.BD.97.E6.98.9F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"焰火拖尾的彗星\">焰火拖尾的彗星</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 焰火拖尾的彗星</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Star Fallen</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"text-align:left\">尊敬的总统阁下：</span><br /><br /><span style=\"text-align:left\">           向您致敬。</span><br /><br /><span style=\"text-align:left\">           请原谅我们给您起的混账外号，但我仍是您最忠诚的部下。</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_bg_huikeshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_bg_huikeshi\"><img alt=\"2_2_bg_huikeshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/Cg-2_2_bg_huikeshi.png/600px-Cg-2_2_bg_huikeshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/Cg-2_2_bg_huikeshi.png/900px-Cg-2_2_bg_huikeshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/Cg-2_2_bg_huikeshi.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_bg_huikeshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>娜娜今天有事，就先由我代班带领大家读诗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人群一阵骚动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅰ：</div><div>娜娜为什么没来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅱ：</div><div>对啊，她平常是最积极那个，她喜欢读诗，我们也喜欢她读诗。她为什么没来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>静静，大伙儿，静静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅱ：</div><div>她是不是还和那群小伙子们鬼混呢？他们带她去俱乐部了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>没有！当然没有！瞎胡闹！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>咱们回到正题上来，来，读诗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>“居住在这片可怜的土地上，居住在这野兽之间”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老金达率先用诗歌打断闲聊，老人们只好顺着她的诗句继续念下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可怜的人啊可怜的兽，一同居住在这岩壑众生之地。<br /><br />沉痛的自由绑架着你，让你不得不化身为兽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>朋友啊朋友，亲吻与爱抚，何时变了副面孔。<br /><br />家人啊家人，温暖的篝火也会变成食人的恶魔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但不一会儿，窃窃私语便开始悄悄进行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅰ：</div><div>……他们说，娜娜可能要离开咱们了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅱ：</div><div>胡说，你从哪儿听的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>咳咳！你们在讨论什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅰ：</div><div>他们、他们说——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>他们说什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老人左右看了看，清了清嗓子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅰ：</div><div>他们说娜娜要走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>全场哗然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>是谁说的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅰ：</div><div>他们，那些小伙子，他们说自己的长官经常去找娜娜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅰ：</div><div>现在整个军营都在传长官给了娜娜一份新活，估计是政府的文书工作，也可能是报社的编辑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅱ：</div><div>总之娜娜要离开这儿了……她要有新的生活了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>正点的报时钟响了三声，无人说话，甚至连衣服摩擦的声音都听不到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>瞎胡闹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老金达放下手里的诗集站起来，骨质疏松和一场史无前例的胃肠手术并没让她的腰杆弯下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>原名金苔丽娅，但是她更喜欢大家叫她金达。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>大伙儿，都听我说一句。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她声音洪亮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在过去的六十五年岁月里，她用绛紫色的手接生过二百六十七个婴儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>二十年前，我将她从臭鱼烂虾的伟大破烂中捡回来。只要我这双眼睛还睁着，我就要对她负责到底。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>我相信大家——也是这么想的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她身上的蒜味，是她接生过的每一个婴儿来到这个世界所感受到的第一种味道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>哼哼哼哼♪♫♪——嘟、嘟嘟嘟——哼哼嘟嘟♪♫♪</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan\"><img alt=\"1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan.png/600px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan.png/900px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan.png/1200px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenlvguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门被敲开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>噢！金达，我正准备去找你。我这儿有一些上次在集市里买到的“哥特佬”带过来的大茴香，我决定用这个做调味料。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>你的东西都收拾好了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>咱们还缺一条很大很大的盖布！我考虑用咱们的旧袜子缝起来，它们结实耐用，还能拿来当桌布。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老金达深深地看着娜娜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>我指的不是为游行准备的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>我指的是你自己的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>我？我这次可绝对没有偷吃，一点都没有，没有一个好人的床头柜少一枚巧克力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老金达不言不语，开始帮她打理起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>牙刷要三个月换一次，跳舞的时候不能穿得太少，和人打招呼要说“你好”，不能给别人起外号。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>不要随便相信别人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>你说这些做什么，这些我都知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老金达不说话，拉开抽屉，帮她挑选衣服。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>嘿嘿，你现在看上去好像我梦里的帕查妈妈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>如果你愿意把人这样想，就很容易掉入圈套。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>得了，别说了。我可不是剥脂怪那样的蠢蛋，你怎么总是把人当作什么都不会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老金达捏了捏鼻梁，深吸一口气，抬起眼看着娜娜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>……金达？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>当太阳神博基卡将大洪水疏导以后，天空出现了彩虹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>你不知道它带来的是赐福，还是厄运。有人认为彩虹是一种拯救，也有人认为彩虹的出现伴随着死亡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>而我……我曾经以帮人预测梦境为生，他们出钱，我占卜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>但每一次，我都愿意相信，我算出来的一切都没有被完全证实为精准。我希望那些预示只是一个模糊的虚影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>因为，每个结果就是一道彩虹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>娜娜愣着，她无法消化这些信息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>或许外面确实是一个新世界，一个年轻人大有可为的世界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老金达拍了拍娜娜的头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>我想让你知道，我不害怕失去你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如果再多下一周雨，那么上校的轮椅会锈得任谁也推不动。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_bg_rongjunyuan2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_bg_rongjunyuan2\"><img alt=\"2_2_bg_rongjunyuan2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Cg-2_2_bg_rongjunyuan2.png/600px-Cg-2_2_bg_rongjunyuan2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Cg-2_2_bg_rongjunyuan2.png/900px-Cg-2_2_bg_rongjunyuan2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Cg-2_2_bg_rongjunyuan2.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_bg_rongjunyuan2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>上校对此比谁都清楚，他不安地晃着腿，滚着轮椅在热情之家的空地上来来去去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他手里捏着用玫瑰色报纸包裹着的一打厚厚信件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他无法滚着这把生锈的轮椅，跋涉数十里格，只身离开福利院，前往邮局。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但很快，他的困境被啜泣声打破。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">上校：</div><div>如果人人都在雨季哭泣，那么这个世界就别想有一天天晴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>上校……？！您、您怎么在这儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">上校：</div><div>我……呃、咳咳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">上校：</div><div>要命，你的哭声就像亚马孙沼泽里的大黑足蚊子，有一搭没一搭，闹得我头疼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>……我没哭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>娜娜抽了抽鼻子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>——我只是感到悲伤，就像下雨一样，没个完……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">上校：</div><div>毫无来由的悲伤，这也是你们年轻人最近的一种消遣活动吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>……刚才，老金达来找我，跟我说了一些听不懂的话，现在我跟您说不出来，我全忘了，我就是觉得很难过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">上校：</div><div>……噢！噢！——好，好吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>上校开始慌张，他看着娜娜的头，想拍一拍安抚一下，却不自主地哼起一首歌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">上校：</div><div>“好呀好呀好男子汉，一枪不说二话，要说谁比他胆子大，只有山头秃鹰与林间的虎。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>听上去像是械斗年代某位独眼诗人的歌曲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>啊拉♪♫♪……啊拉拉♪♫♪……阿——阿嚏——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">上校：</div><div>你看，打个喷嚏，把悲伤打出来就好了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>娜娜吸了吸鼻子，甩了甩头，突然她发现上校背在身后的手里攥着什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>这是什么，上校？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">上校：</div><div>这……这这这是……不许看！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>“我为叨扰您繁忙的工作而深感抱歉，再次向您致敬。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>“这次来信依然是想要询问关于退役金发放的问题。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>“事实上，我在二十五年前已经提交了申请表，在十年前获得了确认名单的答复。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>“对于退役金的金额我并不做过多要求，事实告诉我，我多年的等待与坚守，为的是比数字更有价值的东西。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>“我只是无法忍受一天又一天的日子。即使我现在生活在一个福利院里，这里的日子还算滋润……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>嗯嗯……嗯嗯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>“……但是最近有一帮家伙，他们犹如强盗一般横行霸道，拿出当年械斗时代的蛮横抢夺我们的土地……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>嗯嗯……嗯嗯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>嗯？这里提到我了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-310013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-310013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-310013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>……嗯嗯……“要把她带走……要离开这里……”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>娜娜抬头看看上校，又看看信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>我要离开……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-518611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-518611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-518611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">上校：</div><div>噢老天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>上校看上去慌乱不安。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-518610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-518610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-518610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">上校：</div><div>噢老天……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他滚着轮椅来来回回地踱前踱后。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">上校：</div><div>……帮我一把火烧了它吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他似乎在混乱中突然认清了什么现状并迅速下了一个悲壮的决定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">上校：</div><div>这里病句不断、语法不通、通篇错字，这不是出自我的手笔，你知道的，娜娜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">上校：</div><div>……帮我把它烧了吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>当然，当然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她似乎懂了什么，就如同她第一次听清夜晚的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>您以前是文学会成员，这当然不是您的文笔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-518612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-518612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-518612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">上校：</div><div>哈……哈哈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>上校把信抢过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-518601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-518601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-518601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">上校：</div><div>噢，该死……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他望了望福利院的大门，那儿似乎有一生那么远。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他将信又递给娜娜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">上校：</div><div>……烧了吧……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>娜娜看着上校。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>用那一月有着乌头颜色的眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>夜风中的露台过道，两根柱子之间拉起的铁丝上晾着老人们统一的棉麻白衫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火星如梦幻泡影般在苦涩的呼吸与烤玉米秆的味道中消散。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们看着信纸在火堆里黑朽、卷边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>您说，“老煤渣”现在在做什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>他还在看我们吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-518601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-518601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-518601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">上校：</div><div>他恐怕也正忙着向天堂的代理人写投诉信呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卷边的稿纸最终都化成黑灰，盖在土地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-310001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>娜娜紧紧盯着燃尽的纸灰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310017.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-310017.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310017.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310017.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-310017.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310017.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-310017.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310017.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>上校，我是不会走的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>上校的胡子动了动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-518610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-518610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-518610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">上校：</div><div>你爱走不走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他半天憋出这么一句。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "十月无晴天-04"}}